# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The handbook's parking rule specifies that bays 12 through 30 are reserved for members' vehicles [[cite:obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

Additionally, the handbook states that there is a time limit of two hours for parking in these reserved spaces [[cite:obs-d48398ba78e0543f3c98d8237eb492275013cfab "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].
